// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO4 tagged "button" - confirmed onboard user
// programmable switch (BUTTON_BUILTIN in pins_arduino.h); PandaByte.in
// x32 product page lists "Switches: RST, FLASH, and User Programmable
// buttons" and the merged espressif/arduino-esp32 PR #12220 board-bringup
// notes record it verified via a "Digital Input (Switch)" test.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO12 tagged "led_neopixel" - confirmed onboard
// addressable WS2812B RGB LED (RGB_BUILTIN in pins_arduino.h, driven via
// the core's neopixelWrite()/rgbLedWrite() driver); PandaByte.in x32
// product page explicitly lists "a programmable RGB LED (WS2812B)" and
// PR #12220 notes record it verified via a "Blink RGB (FastLED)" test.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO2 (LED_BUILTIN) left UNTAGGED - PandaByte.in confirms
// a separate onboard "single-color LED" exists, but no source found
// confirming its drive polarity (active-high vs active-low), so no
// led_high/led_low tag was applied. See notes.txt for details.
